            <h3>WPS PIN</h3>
            <p>Your eight digit WPS (Wi-Fi Protected Setup) PIN is static and assigned to your Sky Hub by default. You should enter this PIN if requested by a device you are connecting to your Sky Hub. This <b>PIN</b> appears on the rear panel label on your Sky Hub and also on the Connect card supplied with your Sky Hub packaging. </p>
            </p>
